BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 689.0 Tm (7. Patient education) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 669.5 Tm (Education is given throughout the stay, not only on the day of discharge. Nurses use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 655.0 Tm (the teach-back method: the patient explains the instructions in their own words, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 640.5 Tm (the nurse corrects any misunderstanding. Written instructions are provided in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 626.0 Tm (patient's preferred language. Professional interpreters must be used for patients) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 611.5 Tm (with limited English; family members should not interpret clinical instructions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 580.5 Tm (8. Roles and responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 563.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 563.0 Tm (Attending physician: decides when the patient is medically ready and signs the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 548.5 Tm (discharge order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 531.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 531.0 Tm (Discharging nurse: completes the checklist and the teach-back education.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 513.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 513.5 Tm (Pharmacist: completes medication reconciliation where it is required.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 496.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 496.0 Tm (Case manager: arranges care facility placements, home health services and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 481.5 Tm (equipment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 464.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 464.0 Tm (Transition-of-care nurse: makes the follow-up phone calls described in section 5.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.0 433.0 Tm (9. Document control) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 415.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 415.5 Tm (Policy owner: Director of Nursing Operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 398.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 398.0 Tm (Approved by: Chief Medical Officer, 14 February 2026.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 380.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 380.5 Tm (Effective date: 1 March 2026.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 363.0 Tm (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.0 363.0 Tm (Next review: March 2028. This policy is reviewed every 24 months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76.0 345.5 Tm (Х) Tj ET
